WEBVTT

00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:08.170
<i>Tomorrow, it will be sunny in many parts of the country...</i>

00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:11.730
<i>...with temperatures ordinary for the end of June.</i>

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.410
<i>As for the regional weather.</i>

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.050
Here's your tea, Dad.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.210
Thanks.

00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:28.000
You two are going on your school trip tomorrow, aren't you?

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.050
It's a good experience to learn about Kyoto's historical shrines and temples.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.800
Something simple will do fine for my souvenir.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:39.400
Thanks!

00:00:44.490 --> 00:00:47.440
There's a temple that is famed to be able to fulfill one's love.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:48.400
Do you know it?

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:52.400
I want a charm from there.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:56.280
One from you, to me!

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:19.550
Come in!

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.060
Hey.

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:23.100
What is it?

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.800
Well, it's just...

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.830
...err, you know...

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:32.290
You're bringing that huge trunk with you?

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:33.750
It's just a school trip!

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.160
Who cares?

00:01:35.160 --> 00:01:37.490
This is what I'm most accustomed to using.

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:40.090
Is that really so?

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:45.190
Could it be that you want to bring that stuffed animal along as well?

00:01:45.190 --> 00:01:47.620
O-Of course I wouldn't...

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:49.730
What are you getting flustered about?

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:50.840
Whatever!

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:56.140
Well then...

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.800
...I'll have to start preparing as well.

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:01.200
The souvenir...

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:03.310
What will you do?

00:02:04.110 --> 00:02:05.480
Will you...

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:08.390
...buy the charm for Kirino-chan?

00:02:10.760 --> 00:02:12.900
What if I said I wouldn't?

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:16.230
Kirino-chan will be sad.

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:18.280
Then what about you?

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:19.910
I...!

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:23.710
I... don't know...

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:26.550
I don't know either.

00:02:50.070 --> 00:02:53.990
tomodachi ni mo ienakatta

00:02:55.170 --> 00:02:59.320
omoi wo tojikometa mama no

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:04.410
kokoro no naka mahou no furuutsu

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:09.380
tabereba tsutawaru... nante ne

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:14.990
kyoushitsu de matteita no, mada

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:19.990
guuzen da to iiwake shiteru

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:25.580
sono egao wa tabun dareka no mono

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:31.040
yume ga watashi no negai wo kanaeru nara

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:35.990
sotto agetai purezento yo

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:41.160
anata no niji shiawase ni todoku

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:46.120
hashi e to kaeru wa te wo futte ne

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:51.400
ii no ii no

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:56.750
mitsumeteitai dake nano...

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:14.940
<i>Time of Memories</i>

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:25.010
Hey Riko-chan, look at this!

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:28.040
Don't you think this wallpaper is cute?

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:30.370
Yeah, it's nice.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:37.550
What's wrong, Amami?

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:39.780
Motion sickness?

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.730
Nothing like that.

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:45.800
Actually, I've been investigating about the bullet trains' way of operation.

00:04:46.390 --> 00:04:48.190
From a cost-effectiveness point of view...

00:04:48.190 --> 00:04:51.720
...I don't believe it is necessary to operate past the speed of sound in a country as small as Japan.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:17.880
Sensei, are you checking out the tours for this trip?

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:19.540
You are very dedicated.

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:21.960
Have you made a selection yet?

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:24.700
First we will visit Kiyomizu Temple...

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:27.470
...but I am still considering what to do next.

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:31.850
Kiyomizu Temple is nice, but I can really recommend Arashiyama as well!

00:05:31.850 --> 00:05:34.630
I see... Arashiyama, you say?

00:05:36.060 --> 00:05:38.190
<i>Arashiyama Kindergarten</i>

00:05:41.140 --> 00:05:44.580
Ibuki-san! Over here!

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:46.930
Hey, what are you doing!?

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:49.470
You can't go in here!

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:50.660
You can't!

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.220
You cannot!

00:05:53.530 --> 00:05:55.660
We are going!

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:55.660
- Sorry!

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:01.250
Onii-chan.

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:03.630
What is it?

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:07.170
It's nothing...

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:14.100
Onii-chan, I...

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.280
Amami!

00:06:15.630 --> 00:06:17.230
We're gathering over there!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:36.010
Hey, let's hang out in Fukamine-san's room after dinner.

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.990
That's a good idea! I'm in!

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:44.250
School trips are known to have a high rate of romantic success.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.240
Stop it, you guys.

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:49.550
Oh, who cares?

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:51.420
Don't be so stiff!

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:52.680
That's right.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:56.960
"Leave Fukamine-san in our care, dear Brother."

00:06:57.390 --> 00:06:58.480
Or something like that.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.050
Stop messing around!

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.880
Who the hell would let guys like you...

00:07:02.970 --> 00:07:04.230
What?

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:06.720
What are you getting so serious about?

00:07:06.720 --> 00:07:08.240
Really...

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:11.740
What's your relationship with Fukamine-san anyway?

00:07:12.890 --> 00:07:15.140
It couldn't be a forbidden love?

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.140
No!

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:18.080
Riko is just...

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:23.830
She's... just my little sister.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:33.050
All right! The battle is on!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.560
I might just go out next round!

00:07:35.560 --> 00:07:37.560
I won't let you!

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:41.170
It's your turn, Amami-kun.

00:07:43.930 --> 00:07:45.330
I'm out.

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:46.570
Me too.

00:07:46.570 --> 00:07:50.220
You're both out at the same time again?

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.320
You two make a good match.

00:07:53.610 --> 00:07:55.440
Not really.

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:59.300
You two get along really well, don't you?

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:05.130
Oh my! How suspicious!

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:06.840
He's blushing!

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.670
She's my little sister!

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.360
How nice!

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:15.680
I want a big brother like Amami-kun as well!

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:19.490
It's time for the girls to head into the bath.

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:21.360
The boys should return to their rooms!

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.410
Go back!

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:23.730
Please return!

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.560
Oh well.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:28.570
I guess we'll go to the bath as well.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.610
So I'm your little sister...

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:41.200
I heard you found a good spot?

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:44.030
So, how's the view there?

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:45.470
It's just right.

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:47.470
You can see everything from there.

00:08:47.470 --> 00:08:48.420
Really?

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:51.010
What's up?

00:08:51.010 --> 00:08:52.800
This doesn't concern you.

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.310
That's right.

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.900
What are they up to?

00:08:58.390 --> 00:08:59.100
Amami.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:01.160
That startled me!

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:03.930
Geez, don't scare me like that!

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:07.040
You're as dense as ever.

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.690
You can't even sense when your little sister is in peril.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:12.810
My little sister in peril?

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:27.320
This is my first time in an open air bath!

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:29.380
It's kinda embarrassing!

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:32.220
Makes you feel like someone might be peeking in on you!

00:09:32.220 --> 00:09:34.210
No way!

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:37.010
Don't make a ruckus in the bath!

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:41.260
What's that?

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:42.810
This?

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:46.770
This is racing penguin Pentarou-kun!

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:50.900
Look now.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:54.190
You're not allowed to take toys into the bath.

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:56.300
Yeah, you can't!

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:57.700
You are not allowed to!

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:03.530
H-H-Hey!

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:07.620
Pentarou-kun seems to like you!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:08.770
Hey now!

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:12.720
Not there!

00:10:12.720 --> 00:10:14.830
I'm sensitive there!

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:15.840
Ibuki-san!

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:23.220
Those are Pentarou-kun's relatives, Penta-kun and Penko-chan!

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:25.590
Please get along well!

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.360
Ah! Stop!

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:30.390
No!

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:32.480
Please stop!

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:44.950
You guys!

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:48.790
We're just getting to the good part.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:49.920
Shut up!

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:55.090
Wh-What?

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:02.100
Damn it, you bastards crossed the line!

00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:17.390
It's a misunderstanding!

00:11:23.480 --> 00:11:25.300
Come on, keep moving!

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:26.140
Move it!

00:11:26.140 --> 00:11:27.560
Keep walking!

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:33.580
Man...

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:35.570
That was pretty rough.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.300
Onii-chan!

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:38.640
Wait!

00:11:38.640 --> 00:11:40.260
I said wait!

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:44.870
Like I'm saying, I was trying to stop them!

00:11:45.460 --> 00:11:48.640
Why would I ever peek in on you anyway?

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:55.050
Can't you even trust your big brother!?

00:11:55.050 --> 00:11:58.180
After all I did to protect you from those guys.

00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.360
Seriously.

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:02.910
You protected me?

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:04.760
Why?

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.540
Because I'm your little sister?

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:12.800
No...

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:14.090
So that's how it is...

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:18.380
That's not it!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:21.840
I just didn't want other guys to see you naked!

00:12:23.270 --> 00:12:24.390
Really?

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:26.890
Don't make me repeat myself.

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:30.440
Onii-chan.

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:33.340
So that's how it was!

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:34.900
Sorry.

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.170
Well...

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:37.760
...as long as you understand.

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:44.140
Hey, Onii-chan.

00:12:44.140 --> 00:12:46.360
We're free to go where we want tomorrow, right?

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.120
Do you have any plans?

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:51.370
No, nothing in particular.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:54.750
Then I'm counting on you to go explore Kyoto together!

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:58.170
Right on!

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.770
Make your comeback already!

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:04.750
Pah poh!

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:06.140
What language is that?

00:13:16.320 --> 00:13:22.210
To think I would be able to obtain such a large quantity of bright, angelical smiles...

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:25.110
A magnificent harvest!

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:28.200
What could it be?

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.290
Angels sure like to play practical jokes.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.180
<i>Welcome to Kyoto</i>

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.100
Girlfriend, draw a little closer to your boyfriend!

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:05.460
Boyfriend, smile a bit more!

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:06.900
Sure...

00:14:12.520 --> 00:14:14.200
Delicious!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:15.620
Oh, by the way...

00:14:15.960 --> 00:14:18.720
Here, I thought this might suit you.

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:20.290
Me too.

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:23.340
I thought this might suit you.

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:29.140
A bunny and a turtle!

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:30.720
A good match, huh?

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:31.620
Geez...

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.810
We're two peas in a pod, aren't we?

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:46.360
That was heavy...

00:14:46.360 --> 00:14:48.890
It wasn't that bad, was it?

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:51.370
You sure like to exaggerate.

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:53.370
Huh?

00:14:53.970 --> 00:14:56.480
Doesn't look like anyone is back yet.

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:57.410
Seems so.

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:58.720
So...

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:01.680
...where should I leave the stuff we bought?

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:04.710
Let's see...

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:10.460
You...

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:12.010
That stuffed animal...

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:15.770
So you brought it along after all.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:20.770
I can't sleep without her by my side.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.810
How old are you again?

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:25.780
This one is special.

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:29.280
I've always had her with me up until now.

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:30.630
Special?

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:33.830
Onii-chan, don't you remember?

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.280
What?

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:38.950
You picked her out for me.

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:40.950
Me?

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:44.430
You know, when we were little.

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:47.730
Father said he would give me a birthday present.

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:50.930
So, we all went out to buy something.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:55.930
It was the first time I ever received a birthday present.

00:15:55.930 --> 00:15:58.310
I had trouble deciding on something...

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:00.070
...until you...

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:04.810
I think this will suit you.

00:16:05.790 --> 00:16:06.990
But...

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:08.950
Take this one, here!

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.200
Thanks!

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:18.290
It made me really happy.

00:16:18.290 --> 00:16:20.440
Is... that so?

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:22.110
I'm sorry.

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:24.480
I've seriously forgotten about that.

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:26.790
Oh, Onii-chan...

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:28.880
That's why...

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:33.010
...I decided to keep her with me forever.

00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:38.310
So that I wouldn't forget about you, no matter where I went.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.120
Riko...

00:16:44.090 --> 00:16:45.140
Sorry.

00:16:45.530 --> 00:16:48.140
Even though it was so important to you...

00:16:48.450 --> 00:16:52.320
...I had forgotten all about it.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.250
It's okay!

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:56.030
It's something from when we were little.

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:57.320
You can't help it.

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.900
Even so...

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:01.900
Ever since that time...

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:04.970
Riko...

00:17:05.900 --> 00:17:06.790
I...

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.750
Hello!

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.260
Hey hey, look at this!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:14.650
I bought some charms!

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:16.390
Look, a full set!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:19.880
Traffic safety, good studies, sound health...

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:22.700
...this is easy labor, this is prosperous business...

00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.640
...and to top it off, this is...

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:25.800
Ta-dah!

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.560
The fulfillment of love charm!

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:31.820
With this, Rinka-chan's heart is in the bag!

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:35.360
I have to brag about these in the other rooms as well!

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:37.070
See you!

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:48.670
It's from Kirino.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:56.430
<i>How is Kyoto?</i>

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:02.060
I'm... going to that shrine.

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:08.150
I want you to come with me.

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:23.550
Haruhiko-kun...

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:42.390
A charm is...

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:44.550
...a lot like a Gift, isn't it?

00:18:45.730 --> 00:18:48.810
Both convey how you feel about someone...

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:51.030
...and you put your hopes and feelings into them, right?

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:53.530
That's why...

00:18:54.310 --> 00:18:57.080
...you can't treat them lightly, can you?

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:59.900
They're just that important.

00:19:02.600 --> 00:19:03.570
I...

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.360
...won't buy Kirino's charm.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:08.710
I won't buy it.

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:13.860
Onii-chan...

00:19:22.180 --> 00:19:23.180
I...

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:26.500
...can't lie to my own feelings, after all.

00:19:27.050 --> 00:19:28.520
Onii-chan...

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:32.520
That's why I can't return her feelings.

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:35.450
But... Kirino-chan will...

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:39.540
I feel bad towards Kirino.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:41.140
But...

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:43.780
...the girl I like is you!

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:49.290
Are you really sure?

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:54.880
My feelings haven't changed since the first time we met.

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:57.290
I'm sure they'll never change from now on, either.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:00.280
That's why I...

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.630
Onii-chan.

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:03.120
Before...

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:07.420
