00:20:57.440 --> 00:20:59.680
That eternal rainbow...

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:05.790
I've never been able to tell anyone!

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:08.550
But I...

00:21:08.850 --> 00:21:10.260
I...

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:11.370
Riko.

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:14.440
